# Video is WIP and stays out of git for now.
#
# It is also where this repo's two worst accidents came from. Renders are
# hundreds of MB — every `npm run render` writes another timestamped copy
# beside the last — and, worse, media tracked on one branch becomes untracked
# AND un-ignored the moment you check out a branch whose .gitignore doesn't
# cover it, at which point `git add -A` sweeps the lot into whatever you
# thought you were committing. Ignoring by extension everywhere under video/
# means that can't happen again on any branch.
video/**/renders/
video/**/node_modules/
video/**/*.mp4
video/**/*.mov
video/**/*.webm
video/**/*.wav
video/**/*.m4a
video/**/*.aac
structures_symmetry_symbols.*
planning/
audit/

# Second-generation skill videos: five autonomous agents' workspaces, raw takes
# and renders. Only the finished out/*.gif is worth keeping, and that gets added
# deliberately, never by `git add -A`.
video/gen2/
